OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fheavy rain and strong winds this
OL,7,Fevening. Winds easing as rain clears
OL,8,Fto the east overnight with clear
OL,9,Fspells developing. Becoming cold
OL,10,Fovernight with patchy ice possible in
OL,11,Fthe west.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FIt will be a mostly dry day
OL,14,Fwith long spells of sunshine and light
OL,15,Fwinds. Perhaps the odd shower at first
OL,16,Fover western counties.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
