OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and showers on Saturday. Breezy
OL,7,Fwith bright spells and showers on
OL,8,FSunday. Further rain and strong winds
OL,9,Farriving from the west on Monday and
OL,10,Fbecoming very mild.
